{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/837224-fulfilling-archetypes","id":837224,"title":"Fulfilling Archetypes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-25T14:43:35-08:00","id":837224,"title":"Fulfilling Archetypes","content":"I often feel the texts don't really go into a lot of examples of what a Sin-Eater can do to fulfill their Threshold Resonances and acquire Plasm through it. It's easy enough to figure out what a Torn would do, Death by Violence and all, maybe a Silent too by starving someone to the brink; but what would a Forgotten do? I'm not a hundred on how far one can try to set up a scenario and still let it be chance that nearly/does kill someone, or what a Stricken could do to cash in other than maybe force shitloads of drugs onto someone and make them overdose. Any clear examples to bring for the Thresholds?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also evidently I mixed up the names a bit; the topic name is meant to be &quot;Fulfilling Thresholds&quot; rather than Archetypes, my bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7060,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","user":"Karavolos","date":". 02-25-2016, 06:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T17:53:32-08:00","id":837318,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I really don't know either. I don't what my character would do for threshold resonance (stand in a sinking canoe?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"li